          { "field": "flags.invasionSignsPresent", "op": "eq", "value": false }
        ]
      },
      "actions": ["repeat_colposcopy", "targeted_biopsy"],
      "actionPriority": "primary",
      "explanation": "p16/Ki67 dual stain+ при HPV+ и NILM/ASC-US — триаж в кольпоскопию вместо выжидания (ASCCP Enduring Guidelines 2024, Clarke et al.). Dual stain− → повтор через 12 мес.",
      "sourceIds": ["asccp-enduring-2024-dual-stain", "asccp-2019"]
    },
    {
      "id": "nccn-immunotherapy-advanced",
